{"id":"78c23be8d21cb94d","group":"29","path":"29/29-thm-so-krom-nl.md","title":"SO(Krom) 刻画非确定性对数空间","display":"thm-so-krom-nl — SO(Krom) 刻画非确定性对数空间","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-thm-so-krom-nl","aliases":["29-thm-so-krom-nl"],"display":"thm-so-krom-nl — SO(Krom) 刻画非确定性对数空间","depends_on":["[[29-df-so-krom]]","[[29-df-so-quantifier-semantics]]","[[29-df-ordering]]","[[29-df-complexity-classes]]"],"source_locator":"Theorem 9.32(2), p.154, DjVu scan 169","source_basis":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；陈述已对照，证明核对范围见 Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-thm-so-krom-nl"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-thm-so-krom-nl</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-so-krom-nl — SO(Krom) 刻画非确定性对数空间"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8d766986df2163a0\" href=\"?note=8d766986df2163a0\" title=\"29-df-so-krom\">29-df-so-krom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8372f1f6b9135d87\" href=\"?note=8372f1f6b9135d87\" title=\"29-df-so-quantifier-semantics\">29-df-so-quantifier-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4f651c8d1bdc9a58\" href=\"?note=4f651c8d1bdc9a58\" title=\"29-df-ordering\">29-df-ordering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2017fdd1c0072445\" href=\"?note=2017fdd1c0072445\" title=\"29-df-complexity-classes\">29-df-complexity-classes</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Theorem 9.32(2), p.154, DjVu scan 169"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；陈述已对照，证明核对范围见 Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 为有限关系输入词汇；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;,\\mathrm{SUC},0,\\max\\notin\\tau\">\\(&lt;,\\mathrm{SUC},0,\\max\\notin\\tau\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U=(A,L)\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(U=(A,L)\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SO(Krom)}[\\tau\\cup\\{&lt;,\\mathrm{SUC},0,\\max\\}]\">\\(\\mathrm{SO(Krom)}[\\tau\\cup\\{&lt;,\\mathrm{SUC},0,\\max\\}]\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\">\\(\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\)</span> 见所列定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NL}^{&lt;}[\\tau]\">\\(\\mathrm{NL}^{&lt;}[\\tau]\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2017fdd1c0072445\" href=\"?note=2017fdd1c0072445\" title=\"29-df-complexity-classes\">29-df-complexity-classes</a> 对实际带序结构的拉回。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\">\\(\\iota\\)</span> 为存在唯一见证时的定描述；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U^+\">\\(U^+\\)</span> 在下式构造为一个结构，不是把有序输入对直接当结构。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SUC}_U\\coloneqq\\{(u,v)\\in|A|^2\\mid(u,v)\\in L\\land\\neg\\exists w\\in|A|\\;((u,w)\\in L\\land(w,v)\\in L)\\},\\quad0_U\\coloneqq\\min_L|A|,\\quad\\max_U\\coloneqq\\max_L|A|.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{SUC}_U\\coloneqq\\{(u,v)\\in|A|^2\\mid(u,v)\\in L\\land\\neg\\exists w\\in|A|\\;((u,w)\\in L\\land(w,v)\\in L)\\},\\quad0_U\\coloneqq\\min_L|A|,\\quad\\max_U\\coloneqq\\max_L|A|.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"U^+\\coloneqq\\iota B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau\\cup\\{&lt;,\\mathrm{SUC},0,\\max\\}]\\;\\bigl(|B|=|A|\\land B\\!\\upharpoonright_\\tau=A\\land &lt;^B=L\\land\\mathrm{SUC}^B=\\mathrm{SUC}_U\\land0^B=0_U\\land\\max^B=\\max_U\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[U^+\\coloneqq\\iota B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau\\cup\\{&lt;,\\mathrm{SUC},0,\\max\\}]\\;\\bigl(|B|=|A|\\land B\\!\\upharpoonright_\\tau=A\\land &lt;^B=L\\land\\mathrm{SUC}^B=\\mathrm{SUC}_U\\land0^B=0_U\\land\\max^B=\\max_U\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NL}^{&lt;}[\\tau]=\\{\\{U\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\mid U^+\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\phi\\}\\mid\\phi\\in\\mathrm{SO(Krom)}[\\tau\\cup\\{&lt;,\\mathrm{SUC},0,\\max\\}]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{NL}^{&lt;}[\\tau]=\\{\\{U\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\mid U^+\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\phi\\}\\mid\\phi\\in\\mathrm{SO(Krom)}[\\tau\\cup\\{&lt;,\\mathrm{SUC},0,\\max\\}]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书Theorem9.32，印刷页154、扫描页169，要求有限结构含后继关系。已核对陈述、Lemma9.28存在前缀坍缩及Horn-SAT/2-SAT上界的证明框架；Exercise9.33量词自由归约闭包未独立重证。此次显式构造实际结构扩张，闭合新增符号解释。原书默认n≥2；本库包含单元素域，其有限个输入类型可直接以只含输入文字的CNF分支处理，仍在Horn/Krom片段中；这个有限例外处理为本地补充。没有声称对无序结构捕获相同资源类。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-so-krom","status":"resolved","id":"8d766986df2163a0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-so-krom]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-so-quantifier-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"8372f1f6b9135d87","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-so-quantifier-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ordering","status":"resolved","id":"4f651c8d1bdc9a58","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-ordering]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-complexity-classes","status":"resolved","id":"2017fdd1c0072445","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-complexity-classes]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-complexity-classes","status":"resolved","id":"2017fdd1c0072445","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SO(Krom)}[\\tau\\cup\\{<,\\mathrm{SUC},0,\\max\\}]$ 及 $\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}$ 见所列定义；$\\mathrm{NL}^{<}[\\tau]$ 采用 [[29-df-complexity-classes]] 对实际带序结构的拉回。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"<,\\mathrm{SUC},0,\\max\\notin\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"U=(A,L)\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SO(Krom)}[\\tau\\cup\\{<,\\mathrm{SUC},0,\\max\\}]","display":false},{"tex":"\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NL}^{<}[\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota","display":false},{"tex":"U^+","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SUC}_U\\coloneqq\\{(u,v)\\in|A|^2\\mid(u,v)\\in L\\land\\neg\\exists w\\in|A|\\;((u,w)\\in L\\land(w,v)\\in L)\\},\\quad0_U\\coloneqq\\min_L|A|,\\quad\\max_U\\coloneqq\\max_L|A|.","display":true},{"tex":"U^+\\coloneqq\\iota B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau\\cup\\{<,\\mathrm{SUC},0,\\max\\}]\\;\\bigl(|B|=|A|\\land B\\!\\upharpoonright_\\tau=A\\land <^B=L\\land\\mathrm{SUC}^B=\\mathrm{SUC}_U\\land0^B=0_U\\land\\max^B=\\max_U\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NL}^{<}[\\tau]=\\{\\{U\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\mid U^+\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\phi\\}\\mid\\phi\\in\\mathrm{SO(Krom)}[\\tau\\cup\\{<,\\mathrm{SUC},0,\\max\\}]\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":2125,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-96","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-thm-so-krom-nl]] — SO(Krom) 的 NL 刻画"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-226","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-thm-so-krom-nl]]"},{"id":"bfe1be5f707cc63a","anchor":"ref-13","locati